 "subs": [
  {
   "a": 0.1,
   "b": 2.4,
   "zh": "我连接下来两个月都很难去想。",
   "en": "I feel like it's hard for me to think about the next two months.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 2.9,
   "b": 4.6,
   "zh": "明年？真不知道。",
   "en": "I don't know the next year.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 5.07,
   "b": 7.472,
   "zh": "这是 Anthropic 官方放出的一段对谈",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 7.522,
   "b": 10.36,
   "zh": "主角是 Claude Code 团队的三位工程师",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 10.883,
   "b": 12.513,
   "zh": "负责提问的是 Thariq",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 13.034,
   "b": 15.011,
   "zh": "另外两位是 Sid 和 Robert",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 15.061,
   "b": 16.804,
   "zh": "Robert 正在做 Claude Tag",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 17.332,
   "b": 18.535,
   "zh": "做 Claude Code 的人",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 18.585,
   "b": 20.062,
   "zh": "自己怎么用 Claude Code？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 20.642,
   "b": 21.751,
   "zh": "答案先放在前面",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 21.801,
   "b": 24.402,
   "zh": "他们已经不给它下指令了，只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 24.922,
   "b": 25.892,
   "zh": "这句话站得住吗？",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 26.462,
   "b": 28.353,
   "zh": "站得住，但有一个前提",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 28.403,
   "b": 30.682,
   "zh": "模型得先好到，让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 31.206,
   "b": 32.024,
   "zh": "分三步看",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 32.074,
   "b": 35.713,
   "zh": "第一，人怎么从盯过程，变成只给目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 35.763,
   "b": 39.836,
   "zh": "第二，做出来的功能，为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 39.886,
   "b": 42.006,
   "zh": "第三，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 42.528,
   "b": 43.038,
   "zh": "第一步",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 43.608,
   "b": 44.855,
   "zh": "Sid 七八成的工作",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 44.905,
   "b": 47.388,
   "zh": "都在 Slack 里的 Claude Tag 上完成",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 48.991,
   "b": 50.991,
   "zh": "以前在意每一次工具调用、",
   "en": "caring about each individual tool call",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 50.991,
   "b": 53.491,
   "zh": "模型做的每一个决定；",
   "en": "and each individual decision that the model makes",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 53.491,
   "b": 58.791,
   "zh": "现在退远一步：我有一个目标，我想把它达成。",
   "en": "to just zoomed out view of like, I have a goal and I'd like to achieve this goal.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 59.491,
   "b": 63.091,
   "zh": "然后把这个目标交给模型，让它替你完成。",
   "en": "And you just kind of give that goal to the model to achieve for you.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 63.561,
   "b": 65.067,
   "zh": "这一步只要记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 65.117,
   "b": 67.661,
   "zh": "交给它一个目标，步骤让它自己排",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 68.233,
   "b": 70.883,
   "zh": "第二步，功能为什么要随时准备删",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 71.389,
   "b": 75.389,
   "zh": "给它五件事，做完三件就放弃了。",
   "en": "You'd give it like five things to do and it would do three things and just give up.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 75.989,
   "b": 79.389,
   "zh": "我们就想：要不给它一张待办清单？效果很好。",
   "en": "So we were like, oh, maybe you give it a to-do list and it'll do really well.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 79.389,
   "b": 83.589,
   "zh": "可一年后，它就消失了，待办清单已经用不上了。",
   "en": "But a year from then, it's disappeared. You don't really need the to-do list anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 83.589,
   "b": 88.689,
   "zh": "你得对自己做的东西毫不留恋，",
   "en": "…you got to be very unattached to the things you're building",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 88.689,
   "b": 91.489,
   "zh": "因为它们很快就会消失。",
   "en": "because they're going to go away fairly quickly.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 91.959,
   "b": 94.259,
   "zh": "底层模型，每两个月就换一次",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 94.839,
   "b": 96.079,
   "zh": "Thariq 的说法是—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 96.129,
   "b": 96.249,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 96.751,
   "b": 102.251,
   "zh": "某种程度上，我们就是软件开发未来的「精神时光屋」。",
   "en": "So I think in some ways, we're this hyperbolic time chamber of where software development is going.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 102.721,
   "b": 103.919,
   "zh": "这一步记住一句",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 103.969,
   "b": 106.771,
   "zh": "今天救命的功能，明年可能就是包袱",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 107.344,
   "b": 109.314,
   "zh": "第三步，人最后还剩什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 109.884,
   "b": 111.352,
   "zh": "以前审代码是这样的—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 111.402,
   "b": 111.504,
   "zh": "—",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 112.006,
   "b": 115.706,
   "zh": "审代码的人会挑出三个小毛病发上去，",
   "en": "and they would pick out three little nitpicks to post.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 116.006,
   "b": 119.706,
   "zh": "其实就是在告诉你：这段代码我看过了。",
   "en": "It was kind of just like, I'm signaling to you that I read this code.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 119.706,
   "b": 125.106,
   "zh": "现在，这些小问题可以交给 Claude 自己找、自己改。",
   "en": "Now, you can have Claude figure out those little things and address them autonomously.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 125.506,
   "b": 128.406,
   "zh": "这已经不是人审代码的重点了。",
   "en": "That's not really the important part of human code review anymore.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 128.876,
   "b": 131.674,
   "zh": "现在，人只盯 Claude 没想明白的",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 131.724,
   "b": 134.016,
   "zh": "接口怎么设计，边界划在哪",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 134.596,
   "b": 136.101,
   "zh": "在 Claude Tag 里",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 136.151,
   "b": 137.808,
   "zh": "连它每一步在想什么",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 137.858,
   "b": 138.756,
   "zh": "都看不到了",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 139.26,
   "b": 142.56,
   "zh": "这层抽象，一开始有点吓人。",
   "en": "And that abstraction was like a little scary to get through at first.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 142.66,
   "b": 145.76,
   "zh": "我看不到 Claude 当下在想的每一件事。",
   "en": "I can't see everything that Claude is thinking as it's thinking it.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 145.76,
   "b": 149.56,
   "zh": "就像被逼着放手，让它自己发挥。",
   "en": "And like being forced even to let Claude cook.",
   "kind": "clip"
  },
  {
   "a": 150.03,
   "b": 151.346,
   "zh": "回到开头那个判断",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 151.396,
   "b": 154.25,
   "zh": "站得住，因为模型已经好到让人敢放手",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 154.82,
   "b": 157.761,
   "zh": "模型每两个月换一次，你搭的流程迟早要拆",
   "kind": "nar"
  },
  {
   "a": 157.811,
   "b": 160.28,
   "zh": "能留下来的，只有你给它的那个目标",
   "kind": "nar"
  }
 ],
